cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to Langkah, please cite it as below."
title: "Langkah: pedestrian safety and navigation for Ipoh, Malaysia"
abstract: >-
  An Android app that scores streets for walkers on sidewalks, lighting,
  crossings and reported hazards, compares the safest and the fastest walk,
  guides the walk with hazard alerts, and ranks the improvements walkers ask
  for so the local council can act on them. Built on OpenStreetMap, Supabase
  (PostGIS and pgRouting) and MapLibre.
type: software
authors:
